OL,3,ACars torched and shops looted as
OL,4,Aanti-migrant violence erupts in South
OL,5,AAfrica
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 24 vehicles have been set
OL,8,Fablaze and foreign-owned shops looted
OL,9,Fin South Africa as anti-immigration
OL,10,Fprotests descended into violence in two
OL,11,Fmajor cities, police say.
OL,13,FUnrest broke out on Thursday in Soweto,
OL,14,Fa sprawling township outside
OL,15,FJohannesburg, the country's largest
OL,16,Fcity, and Durban, a major port on the
OL,17,Feast coast.
OL,19,FThe violence comes amid growing anger
OL,20,Fover a court ruling which would allow
OL,21,Fsome migrants who had arrived in the
OL,22,Fcountry illegally to apply for asylum.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
