OL,5,AAfrica
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis had led to long queues outside
OL,8,Fimmigration centres and the government
OL,9,Fon Friday said it would change the way
OL,10,Fit would comply with that ruling,
OL,11,Fwithout giving details.
